090">And </span><span begin="00:40.090" end="00:40.900">I </span><span begin="00:40.900" end="00:41.860">need </span><span begin="00:41.860" end="00:44.350">something </span><span begin="00:44.350" end="00:44.890">to </span><span begin="00:44.890" end="00:46.030">hold</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.090" end="00:50.260"><span begin="00:46.090" end="00:46.330">Make </span><span begin="00:46.330" end="00:46.570">me </span><span begin="00:46.570" end="00:48.070">believe </span><span begin="00:48.070" end="00:48.310">in </span><span begin="00:48.310" end="00:48.640">make </span><span begin="00:48.640" end="00:50.260">beliefs</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.290" end="00:53.110"><span begin="00:50.290" end="00:50.740">Cause </span><span begin="00:50.740" end="00:51.430">after </span><span begin="00:51.430" end="00:51.550">the </span><span begin="00:51.550" end="00:52.150">light </span><span begin="00:52.150" end="00:52.480">is </span><span begin="00:52.480" end="00:52.660">it </span><span begin="00:52.660" end="00:53.110">dark</span><span begin="00:53.110" end="00:53.110">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.110" end="00:58.030"><span begin="00:53.110" end="00:53.500">Is </span><span begin="00:53.500" end="00:53.620">it </span><span begin="00:53.620" end="00:54.070">dark </span><span begin="00:54.070" end="00:54.430">all </span><span begin="00:54.430" end="00:57.520">alone</span><span begin="00:57.520" end="00:58.030">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.030" end="01:06.880"><span begin="00:58.030" end="01:04.060">All </span><span begin="01:04.060" end="01:06.880">alone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.910" end="01:10.660"><span begin="01:06.910" end="01:07.240">You </span><span begin="01:07.240" end="01:07.330">are </span><span begin="01:07.330" end="01:07.570">now </span><span begin="01:07.570" end="01:08.080">listening </span><span begin="01:08.080" end="01:08.230">to </span><span begin="01:08.230" end="01:08.770">103</span><span b